'''Sandstone''' is a solid [[block]] related to [[sand]] that comes in two color variants, the other being [[red sandstone]]. Regular sandstone is commonly found in [[desert]]s and [[beach]]es. Sandstone also has three decorative variants: [[chiseled sandstone]], [[cut sandstone]], and [[smooth sandstone]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sandstone can be mined with any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
{{breaking row
|horizontal=1
|Sandstone
|Pickaxe
|Wood
|link=none
}}

=== Natural generation ===
Regular sandstone generates in [[desert]]s and [[beach]]es compressed underneath several blocks of [[sand]]. It generates at noise cave entrances in desert and beach biomes.

Sandstone can also generate as part of [[desert well]]s, desert [[village]]s, [[desert pyramid]]s, and warm [[ocean ruins]].

