'''Tulips''' are a kind of [[flower]] found in [[plains]] and [[flower forest]]s that come in multiple colored variants: red, orange, white, and pink. They yield dyes of their respective colors, with the exception of white tulips, which yield light gray dye, and all of them are used to craft [[suspicious stew]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
A tulip can be broken instantly with any item or by hand, dropping itself.

A tulip also breaks if [[water]] or [[lava]] runs over its location, if a [[piston]] extends or pushes a block into its location, or if a block under the plant is moved or destroyed.
{{breaking row|Tulip|horizontal=1|sprite=tulips}}

