== Trivia ==
* In real life, a tulip is any member of the [[w:Tulip|''Tulipa'']] genus of flowering plants.
* Despite its name, white tulips give [[Light Gray Dye|light gray dye]] when crafted instead of [[White Dye|white dye]].
* There are two separate textures for all tulips, which are mirrored on the orange and pink tulips to create four unique textures.
* In merchandise there exists yellow, maroon, light blue, and blue tulips that are not seen in-game. They all have the same stem texture, which is unique from existing tulips.

