A '''sea lantern''' is an underwater light source that appears in [[ocean monument]]s and [[ocean ruins]]. It has an animated pulsing texture.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
{{See also|Fortune#Discrete random}}
No tool can accelerate the breaking process of sea lantern.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Sea Lantern|drop=0}}
Sea lantern drops 2~3 [[prismarine crystals]] when it's destroyed using a tool without [[Silk Touch]]. {{IN|java}}, the [[Fortune]] enchantment makes the sea lantern drop extra {{cd|0~level}} prismarine crystals at the equal chances, but it is capped at 5. {{IN|bedrock}}, the number of drops is not affected by Fortune.<ref>{{bug|MCPE-179273}}</ref><br>
Sea lantern drops itself when it's destroyed using a tool with Silk Touch.

=== Natural generation ===
Sea lanterns generate throughout [[ocean monument]]s, as well as in some [[ocean ruins]].

=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting
|A1= Prismarine Shard
|B1= Prismarine Crystals
|C1= Prismarine Shard
